Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:37:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: implement standard Grey Wolf Optimizer (GWO) vector
 mechanics

Add optimizer.GWOEngine, a handle class holding the wolf pack state.

- Random pack initialisation inside the search bounds
- Fitness sorting with elitist alpha/beta/delta tracking
- Vectorised encircling/hunting update: X_new = mean of three
  leader-guided positions, with a decaying linearly from 2 to 0
- Step-wise API (initializePack / proposeCandidates / receiveFitness) so
  a surrogate can later screen candidates between steps
- run() gives the plain GWO baseline; tracks best-fitness history,
  search diversity index and evaluation count
- Tests on the sphere function and on the NetworkEnv problem
